            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_staff01</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">北极跳跃</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">North Pole Vault</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_staff01d</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">一个有固定跳跃范围的撑杆，以防止参与者感到不适
#PA;没有
#AA;北方跳跃</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Teleports wielder and then performs an area cold spell. Description is another joke on how illogical and "missing the point" that the wizarding sports events are.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">A vaulting pole with standardized jumping range to protect the participants from feelings of inadequacy. #PA;None #AA;North Vault</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_staff02</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">永恒繁荣法杖</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Name is a joke on "cheaters never prosper".</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Staff of Eternal Prosperity</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_staff02d</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">如果你把所有目击者都杀光这就不算作弊了。
注：可能有副作用
#PA;没有
#AA;性能增强</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Casts a spell that buffs the wielder for a time after which the caster will become weakened with withdrawal. Description is a simple "it's not cheating if..." joke.  "Performance enhancement" is the idiom for steroids and other "performance enhancing" drugs used by atheletes.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">It's not cheating if you kill all the witnesses. Note: May cause side effects. #PA;None #AA;Performance Enchantment</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_staff03</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">萨美修斯的手持装置</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Holding Apparatus of Saumetheus</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_staff03d</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">萨美修斯本人使用这个装置
从泽维留斯那里带来了永远炙口的辣酱，
因为这是世界上唯一能够驾驭传说辣酱，
不让它变质的东西。
#PA;提升你和附近伙伴的寒冰法术，提升火焰抗性
#AA;无</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Simple staff, the only thing that can hold the olympick event's symbol the "Incessantly Sizzling Spicy Sausage". That extremely strong chilli sausage is never a part of the game mechanic and is just a fun backstory element. Saumetheus = Prometheus, Zovilleus = Zeus + Scoville (of the "strong taste" scale)</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Saumetheus himself used this apparatus to borrow the Incessantly Sizzling Spicy Sausage from Zovilleus, as it is the only thing that can hold the legendary spicy sausage without disintegrating. #PA;Boosts the Cold Spells of you and any nearby allies, Boosts Fire Resistance #AA;None</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
