        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_weapon01</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">加湿器</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">pistol</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Humidity Dispenser</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_weapon01d</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">噢，湿度！
#DMG;没有
#SP;远程，潮湿</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Ranged weapon that makes targets wet. Description is a pun/wordplay on "humiliation" or "humanity"</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Oh, the humidiation! #DMG;None #SP;Ranged, Humidity</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_weapon02</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">滑膛潜艇</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">rifle</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Musketball Dunker</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_weapon02d</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">滑膛弹是一道冲击波！……后面连接着一大串冲击波！
#DMG;爆炸力很强
#SP;远程，造成群体伤害</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Shoots a ball that breaks on impact into a cluster of bombs that blow after a few seconds. Description is a wordplay on being fun ("a blast") and actually explosive blasts. Name is a wordplay on "basketball" and "musket".</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Musketball is a blast! ...followed by a whole bunch of blasts! #DMG;Strong Explosive #SP;Ranged, Bomblet Cluster</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_weapon03</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">小泽维留斯</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">thrown (arc, artillery)</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Zovilleus Junior</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_weapon03d</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">有它哥哥一点儿影子
#DMG;严重的火焰伤害
#SP;灼热大炮</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">A barely survivable shadow of its big brother. #DMG;Heavy Fire Damage #SP;Sizzling Artillery</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_weapon04</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">哑铃</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">thrown (straight line)</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Dumbbells</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_weapon04d</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">大分部被这个击中的人都会变傻，除了我
#DMG;中等物理伤害
#SP;远程，迷惑目标</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Throws dumbbells. The description is a joke on bad grammar from becoming stupid after having been hit by the dumbbell.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Most people that ever got hit by one got real stupid, except I. #DMG;Medium Physical #SP;Ranged, Confuses target</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_weapon05</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">磁力回弹球</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">punch</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Pelota Magtecka</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_weapon05d</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">带有尖刺的关节和球，它比它的名字有趣多了
#DMG;极大的物理伤害
#SP;近程，远程皆可</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">The weapon is a spiked glove that both hits in melee and launches a ball as a weapon. The description is a "vague" under-the-belt joke. The name is Magicka's version of "Pelota Mixteca", an old Mexican sport.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Spiked knuckles and balls. It's much more fun than it sounds. #DMG;Strong Physical #SP;Both melee and ranged</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_weapon06</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">水瓶</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">thrust</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Water Bottle</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_weapon06d</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">含浓缩碳酸湿气！
#DMG;中等物理伤害
#SP;使目标变得潮湿</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">A simple water bottle that is flung (melee) and makes targets in front of you wet. Description is a joke on how "exotic" water is to Wizards, and how convoluted things are in the Magicka wizarding world.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Concentrated de-carbonated dampness contained within! #DMG;Medium Physical #SP;Makes target wet</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_weapon07</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">11号火箭</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">slash</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Elevennis Racket</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#WOOT_item_weapon07d</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">11号整整比9号强大两倍，也要好两倍
#DMG;中等物理伤害
#SP;震退敌人</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">A simple melee tennis racket. Description and name is a wordplay and illogical math joke on the "TEN" in tennis.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Elevennis is a full two greater than ninennis, and thus twice as good. #DMG;Medium Physical #SP;Knockback</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
      </Table>
