    <Worksheet ss:Name="Maps">
      <Table>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">ID</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">zho</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Comments</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Localized texts</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#CHALLENGE_bout_of_madness</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">疯狂回合制</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Pun on the movie 300's line "this is madness" where someone gets kicked into a hole.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Bout of Madness</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#CHALLENGE_bout_of_madnessD</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">观众们喜欢传统而又疯狂的回合制，
尤其是成堆的尸体被推入井中。
把洞填满来赢得你的奖励！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">There are 4 large holes on the map into which units (enemies and players) can fall. If enough fall in, the hole will close for a few moments and become traversable, until it finally opens again. When a hole closes, rewards will spawn in the middle of the map.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">The audience loves a good old bout of madness, especially when tons of bodies are shoved into pits. Fill the holes and receive your reward!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#CHALLENGE_elemental_roulette</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">元素轮盘</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Elemental Roulette</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#CHALLENGE_elemental_rouletteD</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">如果你能掌握所有元素的话
你就是个专家了，
但只有当你在使用其中几个的情况下存活下来时，
你才是个真正的大师！（这名号不是给胆小鬼的！）</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Each wave that passes will enable/disable different predetermined elements. Some wave might, for example, only allow healing and water to be cast, and so on.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You're an expert if you can handle all of the elements, but you're not a true master until you've survived an onslaught using only a few! (NOT for the faint of heart!)</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#CHALLENGE_eye_sockey_rink</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">眼睛曲棍球场</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Wordplay on "Ice Hockey Rink".</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Eye Sockey Rink</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#CHALLENGE_eye_sockey_rinkD</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">一个古老而又需要智慧的游戏，
你得从几对低等巫师的攻击中存活下来……
他们会攻击你的眼睛……很准！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">The floor is slippery ice that can be melted, under which is very shallow water, making units standing in it wet (but capable of moving without slipping).</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">An ancient and tricky sport where you need to survive teams of inferior wizards trying to sock you... in the eye... on ice!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VERSUS_elemental_roulette</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">元素轮盘</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Elemental Roulette</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VERSUS_elemental_rouletteD</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">分辨出冠军选手和炮灰，
适应元素猛烈波动的竞技场！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Only 3 out of 8 elements are active at any one time and change randomly every 30 or so seconds.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Separating the champions from the cannon fodder. Adapt quickly in an arena where the elements fluctuate wildly!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VERSUS_diamond_ring</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">钻戒</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Diamond Ring</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VERSUS_diamond_ringD</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">传统而又简单，让大地被你对手的鲜血染红吧！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Simple map shaped like a diamond. The name is a pun on "boxing ring" and the diamond shape of the map.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Traditional and simple. Make the ground sparkle with the ruby red blood of your opponents!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VERSUS_halls_of_moisture</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">不可拒绝湿度的游泳池</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Pool of Undeniable Moisture</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VERSUS_halls_of_moistureD</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">难道这是一个奇葩的竞技场，
或者巫师们本来就能游泳。
自然情况下是不行的，
你也许需要站着静静思考一会儿</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">The map's floor is comprised out of 9 platforms that randomly sink into deep water, drowning wizards that happen to fall in.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Were this some other arena, or if wizards could indeed swim -- which naturally they cannot -- you might have time to stand still for a moment and think.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VERSUS_prize_podium</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">领奖台</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Prize Podium</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VERSUS_prize_podiumD</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你战斗到了最后，差点就一无所获。
那么，按照惯例，只有一人能拿起那杯……
冰镇安魂奶！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">A simple arena where nothing special happens. It's the wizard world's prize podium with 4 platforms each representing the winners rankings, and in the middle of the map is a large trophy.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You've fought your way to the end and almost broken into a sweat doing so. Now, as tradition dictates there can be only one holding the cup... of ice-cold soothing milk!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
      </Table>
    </Worksheet>
